            <div xml:id="d301">

                <pb facs="0751" n="716" sameAs="frus:frus1964-68v32/pg716"/>

                <head>301. Memorandum Prepared for the 303 Committee<anchor n="1" xml:id="d301-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1965-03-22">March 22, 1965</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Status of Termination of Manuel Artimeʼs Autonomous Paramilitary
                        Group</item>
                </list>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>In accordance with the decision of the Committee on 4 March 1965,<anchor
                            n="2" xml:id="d301-f2"/> CIA has begun phasing-out support to
                        Artime.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>
                        <p> Artime has agreed to cooperate in the disbanding of his paramilitary
                            group. [<hi rendition="#italic">5 lines of source text not
                                declassified</hi>]</p>
                        <p>[<hi rendition="#italic">6 paragraphs (1½ pages of double-spaced source
                                text) not declassified</hi>]</p>
                    </item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d301-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d301-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, INR/IL Historical Files, 5412 Special Group/303
                    Committee Records, January–June, 1965. Secret; Eyes Only. Circulated to 303
                    Committee principals at the March 30 meeting, according to an April 2 memorandum
                    from Williams to Vaughn. (Ibid.)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d301-f2" n="2" xml:id="d301-f2-content">
